bluejetty:00016115:ios.description:
Play Burraco for FREE with your friends or against the computer, directly on your iPhone and iPad!
Rediscover the pleasure of Burraco in a simple, fun environment suitable for everyone.
Join a large community of enthusiasts: join a Club, participate in tournaments and special events, and experience exciting challenges.
You can chat with your friends, meet new people, and always feel part of a group.
With over 100,000 active players, there's always a table ready to welcome you!
Key Features
• Play on iPhone and iPad;
• Choose from a variety of modes: Italian Burraco, Royal Burraco, Open, Closed, and STBL;
• Play online with your friends via Wi-Fi or mobile network;
• Participate in ever-changing tournaments and daily events;
• Climb your personal and club rankings;
• Unlock many fun achievements;
• 2- or 4-player modes;
• Challenge the computer even without an internet connection and resume games whenever you want;
• Create your own club or join an existing one and challenge other players;
• Chat easily with private messages, club chat, and lots of fun emoticons;
• Become a VIP user to unlock all the exclusive features;

